@startuml
title Сценарий с ошибкой: Payment Service недоступен

actor "Официант" as Waiter
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Payment Service" as PaySvc
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "Event Bus\n(RabbitMQ)" as Bus
participant "Payment\nWorker" as PayWorker
participant "Acquiring\nGateway\n(Stripe)" as Stripe

note over Waiter, Stripe
  Заказ ORD-2024-0318 выполнен.
  Официант формирует счёт и проводит оплату.
end note

Waiter -> Gateway: POST /api/orders/ORD-2024-0318/pay\n{method: "CARD",\namount: 4750.00,\ntip: 475.00}
activate Gateway

Gateway -> PaySvc: Пересылка запроса
activate PaySvc

PaySvc -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB

PaySvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM orders\nWHERE id='ORD-2024-0318'\nAND status='READY'\nFOR UPDATE
DB --> PaySvc: order\n(total=4750.00)

PaySvc -> DB: INSERT INTO payments\n(id='PAY-0318', order_id='ORD-2024-0318',\namount=5225.00, status='PENDING')
DB --> PaySvc: OK

PaySvc -> DB: UPDATE orders\nSET status='AWAITING_PAYMENT'\nWHERE id='ORD-2024-0318'
DB --> PaySvc: OK

PaySvc -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> PaySvc: Committed
deactivate DB

note over PaySvc
  Платёж зарегистрирован в БД.
  Отправка в эквайринг асинхронна.
end note

PaySvc -> Bus: publish(PaymentInitiated,\npayment_id='PAY-0318')
activate Bus
Bus --> PaySvc: ACK
deactivate Bus

PaySvc --> Gateway: 202 Accepted\n{payment_id: "PAY-0318",\nstatus: "PENDING"}
deactivate PaySvc

Gateway --> Waiter: 202 Accepted\n{payment_id: "PAY-0318",\nstatus: "PENDING"}
deactivate Gateway

note over Waiter
  Официант получил подтверждение
  регистрации платежа. Ожидание...
end note

== Асинхронная обработка платежа ==

Bus -> PayWorker: consume(PaymentInitiated)
activate PayWorker

PayWorker -> PayWorker: Подготовка\nданных транзакции

PayWorker -> Stripe: chargeCard(\n{payment_id: "PAY-0318",\namount: 5225.00,\ncurrency: "RUB",\ncard_token: "tok_xyz"})
activate Stripe

note over Stripe #FFAAAA
  Acquiring Gateway недоступен!
  Connection timeout 15s
end note

Stripe --x PayWorker: TimeoutException\nafter 15s
deactivate Stripe

PayWorker -> PayWorker: Обработка ошибки:\n- НЕ откатываем платёж из БД\n- Помещаем в retry queue

PayWorker -> DB: UPDATE payments\nSET status='RETRY_PENDING',\nretry_count=1,\nlast_error='Acquiring timeout',\nnext_retry_at=NOW()+3min\nWHERE id='PAY-0318'
activate DB
DB --> PayWorker: OK
deactivate DB

PayWorker -> Bus: publish(PaymentFailed,\npayment_id='PAY-0318',\nreason='Acquiring timeout')
activate Bus
Bus --> PayWorker: ACK
deactivate Bus

note over PayWorker #FFFFAA
  Платёж поставлен в очередь повтора.
  Фоновый worker повторит попытку
  через 3 минуты (макс. 3 попытки).
end note

deactivate PayWorker

== Повторная попытка через 3 минуты ==

PayWorker -> PayWorker: Запланировано\nповторное выполнение


activate PayWorker
PayWorker -> DB: SELECT * FROM payments\nWHERE status='RETRY_PENDING'\nAND next_retry_at <= NOW()
activate DB
DB --> PayWorker: 1 запись\n(payment_id='PAY-0318')
deactivate DB

PayWorker -> Stripe: chargeCard(\n{payment_id: "PAY-0318",\namount: 5225.00, ...})
activate Stripe
Stripe --> PayWorker: transaction_id: "txn-9981"\nStatus: succeeded ✅
deactivate Stripe

PayWorker -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB

PayWorker -> DB: UPDATE payments\nSET status='COMPLETED',\ntransaction_id='txn-9981',\npaid_at=NOW()\nWHERE id='PAY-0318'
DB --> PayWorker: OK

PayWorker -> DB: UPDATE orders\nSET status='PAID'\nWHERE id='ORD-2024-0318'
DB --> PayWorker: OK

PayWorker -> DB: UPDATE tables\nSET status='FREE',\nactive_order_id=NULL\nWHERE id=12
DB --> PayWorker: OK

PayWorker -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> PayWorker: Committed
deactivate DB

PayWorker -> Bus: publish(PaymentCompleted,\npayment_id='PAY-0318',\norder_id='ORD-2024-0318')
activate Bus
Bus --> PayWorker: ACK
deactivate Bus

note over PayWorker #AAFFAA
  Оплата проведена успешно!
  Столик освобождён.
end note

deactivate PayWorker

@enduml